# Error Codes {#error-list}

Error responses are Problem Details {{RFC9457}} with the media type "application/problem+json", whatever serialization the registration uses, and an extension member "code" holding one of the codes below:

~~~json
{
  "type": "about:blank",
  "status": 404,
  "title": "Not Found",
  "code": "REGISTRATION_NOT_FOUND",
  "detail": "No registration reg-7a3b9c2e"
}
~~~

| Status | Code | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| 400 | INVALID_REQUEST | Malformed body or missing required fields |
| 400 | INVALID_FILTER | Filter is syntactically invalid |
| 400 | MISSING_REQUEST_ID | MTA-Hooks-Request-Id is missing |
| 401 | AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED | No credentials were provided |
| 401 | INVALID_CREDENTIALS | Credentials are invalid or expired |
| 403 | REGISTRATION_DENIED | The MTA may not register |
| 403 | REGISTRATION_MISMATCH | Credentials are not bound to the registration |
| 404 | REGISTRATION_NOT_FOUND | No such registration |
| 409 | REGISTRATION_LIMIT_REACHED | Too many registrations for this MTA |
| 413 | REQUEST_TOO_LARGE | Request body larger than the scanner accepts |
| 422 | UNSUPPORTED_SERIALIZATION | The serialization is not supported |
| 422 | UNSUPPORTED_STAGE | A stage is not supported |
| 422 | UNSUPPORTED_PROPERTY | A property is not supported |
| 422 | UNSUPPORTED_FILTER | A filter condition is not supported |
| 429 | RATE_LIMITED | Too many requests |
| 500 | INTERNAL_ERROR | Unexpected error |
| 503 | UNAVAILABLE | Temporarily unable to process requests |
{: #tab-errors title="Error Codes"}

